Dear Reviewers, 

we are grateful for your constructive and insightful reviews!
We are encouraged by the fact that you acknowledge the well-written text of our paper (Reviewers BuZV, aRUC) and agree on the novelty and clarity of our theoretical results (Reviewers aRUC, 1LsA).  

Below, we provide a list of the **main changes** incorporated into the *revised version of our paper*:

- **[Reviewers umCk, aRUC]** New remark 4.8 regarding the $\beta$-strong convexity assumption (*Section 4*);

- **[Reviewer BuZV]** Experiments with non-neural baseline estimators (*new Appendix C.1*);

- **[Reviewer BuZV]** Illustrations of the OT solver's results in experiments with approximation error (*new Appendix C.3*);

- **[Reviewer aRUC]** New high-dimensional experiments on the estimation error (*new Appendix C.2*);

- **[Reviewer 1LsA]** Shortening Section 2, removing some theoretical background on the OT with general cost function.

Apart from this, we fix the typos, include missing related work and incorporate necessary clarifications suggested by the reviewers. All changes in the revised version are highlighted in **blue color**.

Best regards,
the Authors
